  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Whenever desktop users alt-tab out from VRchat I'd like it to activate the AFK animation, unless it's been manually disabled of course.\nHowever this should not be the case for VR users, since that would basically render any overlay app useless and the point of the AFK animation is to let other people know you're away. If you're still wearing your VR HMD then you're still around.",
